        "theoryUz": "### Context window chegarasi\n\n**1. Konseptual Asos va Muammo (Core Problem & Concept):**\n“Context window chegarasi” — zamonaviy AI injiniring tizimlarida AI va LLM Qanday Ishlaydi (Tokenlar & Truncation) yo'nalishining asosiy ustunlaridan biridir.\nBu mavzuda asosiy e'tibor quyidagi terminologik tushunchalarga qaratiladi: Token, Byte-Pair Encoding (BPE), Context Window, Vocab Size, Softmax, Autoregressive Generation.\nAI muhandisligida bu konsepsiya tizimning ishonchliligi, hisoblash tezligi (low latency) va resurslarni tejamkor boshqarish uchun xizmat qiladi.\n\n**2. Ishlash Mexanizmi va Arxitektura (Under the Hood):**\nAmaliy arxitekturada ma'lumotlar oqimi quyidagi mantiqiy ketma-ketlikda ishlaydi:\n1. Kiruvchi so'rov tekshiriladi va kerakli ma'lumotlar formatiga o'tkaziladi.\n2. Tegishli algoritm yoki API xizmati yordamida deterministik hamda ehtimollik qoidalari asosida inferens bajariladi.\n3. Chiqish ma'lumotlari strukturalanadi va xatoliklar (chegaraviy holatlar) nazoratdan o'tkaziladi.\n\n**3. Ishlab chiqarish Qoidalari (Production Best Practices):**\nProduction muhitida har doim kutilmagan uzilishlar, tokenlar sarfi va kechikishlarni (P95/P99 latency) kuzatib borish talab etiladi.",
        "upstreamUrl": "https://github.com/Asabeneh/30-Days-Of-AI-Engineering/blob/391a9cc44add20cf19965e171c6e7fed3a183e67/day_02/day_02_introduction_to_ai_engineering.md",
        "visualFlow": [
          {
            "step": 1,
            "label": "Matn (String)",
            "detail": "Xom foydalanuvchi matni"
          },
          {
            "step": 2,
            "label": "BPE Tokenizer",
            "detail": "Matnni subword tokenlarga ajratish va ID larni olish"
          },
          {
            "step": 3,
            "label": "Embedding & Transfomer",
            "detail": "Keyingi token ehtimolliklarini hisoblash"
          },
          {
            "step": 4,
            "label": "Detokenizer",
            "detail": "Bashorat qilingan token ID larni qayta matnga o'girish"
          }
        ],
        "examples": [
          {
            "titleUz": "1-misol: Context window chegarasi — BPE Subword Tokenlash Simulyatsiyasi",
            "code": "def simple_bpe_tokenize(word: str, vocab: dict[str, int]) -> list[int]:\n    tokens = []\n    i = 0\n    while i < len(word):\n        matched = False\n        for length in range(len(word) - i, 0, -1):\n            sub = word[i:i + length]\n            if sub in vocab:\n                tokens.append(vocab[sub])\n                i += length\n                matched = True\n                break\n        if not matched:\n            tokens.append(vocab.get(\"<UNK>\", 0))\n            i += 1\n    return tokens\n\nvocab = {\"un\": 1, \"break\": 2, \"able\": 3, \"<UNK>\": 0}\nres = simple_bpe_tokenize(\"unbreakable\", vocab)\nprint(\"So'z: unbreakable -> Token IDlar:\", res)",
            "expectedOutput": "So'z: unbreakable -> Token IDlar: [1, 2, 3]",
            "explanationUz": "BPE (Byte-Pair Encoding) so'zlarni eng ko'p uchraydigan subword bo'laklarga ajratadi va lug'atdagi ID sini topadi."
          },
          {
            "titleUz": "2-misol: Context window chegarasi — Kontekst Hajmi (Context Window) Xavfsiz Truncation",
            "code": "def truncate_to_token_limit(tokens: list[int], max_tokens: int = 4) -> list[int]:\n    if len(tokens) <= max_tokens:\n        return tokens\n    # Oxirgi muhim qismini saqlash (recency bias)\n    return tokens[-max_tokens:]\n\ntoken_ids = [101, 2045, 1002, 304, 55, 99]\npruned = truncate_to_token_limit(token_ids, max_tokens=3)\nprint(f\"Asl uzunlik: {len(token_ids)} -> Qisqartirilgan: {pruned}\")",
            "expectedOutput": "Asl uzunlik: 6 -> Qisqartirilgan: [304, 55, 99]",
            "explanationUz": "LLM lar qat'iy kontekst oynasiga ega (masalan 128k token). Limitdan oshganda xavfsiz qisqartirish (truncation) talab etiladi."
          }
        ],
