        "theoryUz": "### Matn va multimodal imkoniyat\n\n**1. Konseptual Asos va Muammo (Core Problem & Concept):**\n“Matn va multimodal imkoniyat” — zamonaviy AI injiniring tizimlarida Tayyor Modellar va Provayderlar Ekosistemasi yo'nalishining asosiy ustunlaridan biridir.\nBu mavzuda asosiy e'tibor quyidagi terminologik tushunchalarga qaratiladi: Proprietary vs Open-Weight, Latency vs Quality, Benchmark (MMLU, HumanEval), Rate Limits, Model Router.\nAI muhandisligida bu konsepsiya tizimning ishonchliligi, hisoblash tezligi (low latency) va resurslarni tejamkor boshqarish uchun xizmat qiladi.\n\n**2. Ishlash Mexanizmi va Arxitektura (Under the Hood):**\nAmaliy arxitekturada ma'lumotlar oqimi quyidagi mantiqiy ketma-ketlikda ishlaydi:\n1. Kiruvchi so'rov tekshiriladi va kerakli ma'lumotlar formatiga o'tkaziladi.\n2. Tegishli algoritm yoki API xizmati yordamida deterministik hamda ehtimollik qoidalari asosida inferens bajariladi.\n3. Chiqish ma'lumotlari strukturalanadi va xatoliklar (chegaraviy holatlar) nazoratdan o'tkaziladi.\n\n**3. Ishlab chiqarish Qoidalari (Production Best Practices):**\nProduction muhitida har doim kutilmagan uzilishlar, tokenlar sarfi va kechikishlarni (P95/P99 latency) kuzatib borish talab etiladi.",
        "upstreamUrl": "https://github.com/Asabeneh/30-Days-Of-AI-Engineering/blob/391a9cc44add20cf19965e171c6e7fed3a183e67/day_01/day_01_introduction_to_ai_engineering.md",
        "visualFlow": [
          {
            "step": 1,
            "label": "Vazifa Tahlili",
            "detail": "Murakkablik (Oddiy javob vs Chuqur tahlil / Kod)"
          },
          {
            "step": 2,
            "label": "Model Router",
            "detail": "Xarajat va kechikish bo'yicha eng optimal modelni tanlash"
          },
          {
            "step": 3,
            "label": "Inference Chaqiruvi",
            "detail": "Tanlangan provayderga (OpenAI/Gemini/DeepSeek) so'rov"
          },
          {
            "step": 4,
            "label": "Zaxira (Fallback)",
            "detail": "Agar birlamchi modelda 429 yoki 503 bo'lsa zaxiraga o'tish"
          }
        ],
        "examples": [
          {
            "titleUz": "1-misol: Matn va multimodal imkoniyat — Dinamik Model Router (Tejamkor vs Murakkab)",
            "code": "def route_model_by_task(task_type: str, query_length: int) -> str:\n    if task_type == \"coding\" or query_length > 2000:\n        return \"claude-3-5-sonnet\"  # Yuqori mantiqiy aniqlik\n    elif task_type == \"quick_classification\":\n        return \"gpt-4o-mini\"        # Minimal kechikish va arzon\n    return \"gemini-1.5-flash\"       # Katta kontekst va o'rtacha xarajat\n\nprint(\"Kodlash vazifasi uchun:\", route_model_by_task(\"coding\", 500))\nprint(\"Klassifikatsiya uchun:\", route_model_by_task(\"quick_classification\", 100))",
            "expectedOutput": "Kodlash vazifasi uchun: claude-3-5-sonnet\nKlassifikatsiya uchun: gpt-4o-mini",
            "explanationUz": "Barcha vazifalarni eng qimmat modelga yuborish samarasiz. Aqlli marshrutlash orqali xarajatlarni 70% gacha tejash mumkin."
          },
          {
            "titleUz": "2-misol: Matn va multimodal imkoniyat — Provayder Fallback (Zaxira) Tizimi",
            "code": "def execute_with_fallback(prompt: str, providers: list[str]) -> dict:\n    for prov in providers:\n        # Agar provayder 'fail' bersa keyingisiga o'tadi\n        if prov == \"primary_offline\":\n            continue\n        return {\"chosen_provider\": prov, \"status\": \"ok\", \"response\": f\"Javob {prov} tomonidan berildi\"}\n    return {\"status\": \"all_failed\"}\n\nres = execute_with_fallback(\"Salom\", [\"primary_offline\", \"openai_backup\", \"local_backup\"])\nprint(\"Natija:\", res[\"chosen_provider\"])",
            "expectedOutput": "Natija: openai_backup",
            "explanationUz": "Production AI arxitekturasida bitta provayderga 100% bog'lanib qolmaslik (High Availability) shart."
          }
        ],
