        "theoryUz": "### Model checkpoint va tokenizer\n\n**1. Konseptual Asos va Muammo (Core Problem & Concept):**\n“Model checkpoint va tokenizer” — zamonaviy AI injiniring tizimlarida Lokal Modellar va Open-Weight Inference yo'nalishining asosiy ustunlaridan biridir.\nBu mavzuda asosiy e'tibor quyidagi terminologik tushunchalarga qaratiladi: Ollama, vLLM, GGUF, Quantization (4-bit, 8-bit), VRAM Talabi, KV Cache Memory.\nAI muhandisligida bu konsepsiya tizimning ishonchliligi, hisoblash tezligi (low latency) va resurslarni tejamkor boshqarish uchun xizmat qiladi.\n\n**2. Ishlash Mexanizmi va Arxitektura (Under the Hood):**\nAmaliy arxitekturada ma'lumotlar oqimi quyidagi mantiqiy ketma-ketlikda ishlaydi:\n1. Kiruvchi so'rov tekshiriladi va kerakli ma'lumotlar formatiga o'tkaziladi.\n2. Tegishli algoritm yoki API xizmati yordamida deterministik hamda ehtimollik qoidalari asosida inferens bajariladi.\n3. Chiqish ma'lumotlari strukturalanadi va xatoliklar (chegaraviy holatlar) nazoratdan o'tkaziladi.\n\n**3. Ishlab chiqarish Qoidalari (Production Best Practices):**\nProduction muhitida har doim kutilmagan uzilishlar, tokenlar sarfi va kechikishlarni (P95/P99 latency) kuzatib borish talab etiladi.",
        "upstreamUrl": "https://github.com/Asabeneh/30-Days-Of-AI-Engineering/blob/391a9cc44add20cf19965e171c6e7fed3a183e67/day_00/day_00_getting_started.md",
        "visualFlow": [
          {
            "step": 1,
            "label": "Model Tanlovi",
            "detail": "Llama-3, Qwen, Mistral open-weight vaznlar"
          },
          {
            "step": 2,
            "label": "Kvantizatsiya (GGUF)",
            "detail": "16-bit floatdan 4-bit butun songa siqish"
          },
          {
            "step": 3,
            "label": "VRAM Hisoblash",
            "detail": "Model og'irliklari + KV cache xotirasini ajratish"
          },
          {
            "step": 4,
            "label": "Lokal Server (Ollama)",
            "detail": "Maxfiy ma'lumotlarni internetga chiqarmasdan yechish"
          }
        ],
        "examples": [
          {
            "titleUz": "1-misol: Model checkpoint va tokenizer — Model VRAM Talabini Hisoblash Formula Simulyatsiyasi",
            "code": "def estimate_model_vram_gb(param_billions: float, precision_bits: int = 4) -> float:\n    # Vaznlar xotirasi (GB)\n    weight_gb = (param_billions * 1e9 * (precision_bits / 8)) / (1024**3)\n    # KV Cache va inferens qo'shimcha xarajati (~25%)\n    total_gb = weight_gb * 1.25\n    return round(total_gb, 2)\n\n# Llama-3 8B modeli 4-bit (Q4_K_M) va 16-bitda\nprint(\"8B Model (4-bit):\", estimate_model_vram_gb(8.0, 4), \"GB VRAM\")\nprint(\"8B Model (16-bit):\", estimate_model_vram_gb(8.0, 16), \"GB VRAM\")",
            "expectedOutput": "8B Model (4-bit): 4.66 GB VRAM\n8B Model (16-bit): 18.63 GB VRAM",
            "explanationUz": "Kvantizatsiya (Quantization) orqali 8B modelni atigi 5 GB VRAM ga sig'dirib, oddiy noutbukda ham ishlatish mumkin."
          },
          {
            "titleUz": "2-misol: Model checkpoint va tokenizer — Lokal Ollama API Mijoz Wrappiri",
            "code": "def build_ollama_request(model_name: str, prompt: str) -> dict:\n    return {\n        \"model\": model_name,\n        \"prompt\": prompt,\n        \"stream\": False,\n        \"options\": {\"temperature\": 0.3, \"num_ctx\": 4096}\n    }\n\npayload = build_ollama_request(\"llama3.1:8b\", \"O'zbekistonda nechta viloyat bor?\")\nprint(\"Lokal chaqiruv modeli:\", payload[\"model\"], \"| Kontekst:\", payload[\"options\"][\"num_ctx\"])",
            "expectedOutput": "Lokal chaqiruv modeli: llama3.1:8b | Kontekst: 4096",
            "explanationUz": "Lokal modellar korxona maxfiy ma'lumotlarini (On-Premise) tashqi serverlarga chiqarmaslik uchun qo'llanadi."
          }
        ],
        "commonMistakes": [
          {
            "mistakeUz": "KV Cache xotirasini hisobga olmasdan VRAM ni to'liq modelga ajratish",
            "symptomUz": "Kontekst kattalashishi bilan server 'CUDA Out of Memory' xatosi bilan to'xtaydi.",
            "correctionUz": "Har doim KV cache uchun kamida 20-30% qo'shimcha VRAM zaxirada qoldiring."
          },
          {
            "mistakeUz": "O'ta kuchli kvantizatsiya (masalan, 2-bit) tufayli model mantiqini buzib qo'yish",
            "symptomUz": "Model gallyutsinatsiyaga beriladi va ma'nosiz so'zlarni takrorlayveradi.",
            "correctionUz": "Optimal muvozanat uchun 4-bit (Q4_K_M) yoki 5-bit (Q5_K_M) kvantizatsiyadan foydalaning."
          }
        ],
