        "theoryUz": "### Embedding generation\n\n**1. Konseptual Asos va Muammo (Core Problem & Concept):**\n“Embedding generation” — zamonaviy AI injiniring tizimlarida RAG Quvuri: Hujjatlarni Indekslash yo'nalishining asosiy ustunlaridan biridir.\nBu mavzuda asosiy e'tibor quyidagi terminologik tushunchalarga qaratiladi: Chunk Size, Chunk Overlap, Recursive Character Splitting, Metadata Enrichment, Ingestion Pipeline.\nAI muhandisligida bu konsepsiya tizimning ishonchliligi, hisoblash tezligi (low latency) va resurslarni tejamkor boshqarish uchun xizmat qiladi.\n\n**2. Ishlash Mexanizmi va Arxitektura (Under the Hood):**\nAmaliy arxitekturada ma'lumotlar oqimi quyidagi mantiqiy ketma-ketlikda ishlaydi:\n1. Kiruvchi so'rov tekshiriladi va kerakli ma'lumotlar formatiga o'tkaziladi.\n2. Tegishli algoritm yoki API xizmati yordamida deterministik hamda ehtimollik qoidalari asosida inferens bajariladi.\n3. Chiqish ma'lumotlari strukturalanadi va xatoliklar (chegaraviy holatlar) nazoratdan o'tkaziladi.\n\n**3. Ishlab chiqarish Qoidalari (Production Best Practices):**\nProduction muhitida har doim kutilmagan uzilishlar, tokenlar sarfi va kechikishlarni (P95/P99 latency) kuzatib borish talab etiladi.",
        "upstreamUrl": "https://github.com/Asabeneh/30-Days-Of-AI-Engineering/blob/391a9cc44add20cf19965e171c6e7fed3a183e67/day_17/day_17_introduction_to_ai_engineering.md",
        "visualFlow": [
          {
            "step": 1,
            "label": "Xom Hujjatlar (PDF/Doc)",
            "detail": "Matnni ajratib olish va tozalash"
          },
          {
            "step": 2,
            "label": "Bo'laklash (Chunking)",
            "detail": "Chunk size va overlap parametrlarida ajratish"
          },
          {
            "step": 3,
            "label": "Vektorlashtirish",
            "detail": "Har bir bo'lak uchun embedding yaratish"
          },
          {
            "step": 4,
            "label": "Indekslash",
            "detail": "Vektor bazaga metadata bilan saqlash"
          }
        ],
        "examples": [
          {
            "titleUz": "1-misol: Embedding generation — Overlap bilan Sliding Window Chunking Funksiyasi",
            "code": "def split_text_with_overlap(text: str, chunk_size: int = 40, overlap: int = 10) -> list[str]:\n    chunks = []\n    step = chunk_size - overlap\n    for i in range(0, len(text), step):\n        chunk = text[i:i + chunk_size]\n        if chunk:\n            chunks.append(chunk)\n        if i + chunk_size >= len(text):\n            break\n    return chunks\n\nmatn = \"Sun'iy intellekt muhandisligi zamonaviy arxitektura va katta modellarni integratsiya qilish sohasidir.\"\nch = split_text_with_overlap(matn, chunk_size=30, overlap=10)\nprint(\"Bo'laklar soni:\", len(ch))\nprint(\"1-bo'lak:\", ch[0])\nprint(\"2-bo'lak (overlap bilan):\", ch[1])",
            "expectedOutput": "Bo'laklar soni: 4\n1-bo'lak: Sun'iy intellekt muhandislig\n2-bo'lak (overlap bilan): handisligi zamonaviy arxitek",
            "explanationUz": "Chunk overlap bo'laklar orasidagi mazmun uzilib qolmasligini kafolatlaydi, so'nggi jumlalar keyingi bo'lakka ulanadi."
          },
          {
            "titleUz": "2-misol: Embedding generation — Bo'laklarni Metadata bilan Boyitish",
            "code": "def create_enriched_chunk(chunk_id: int, content: str, source_doc: str) -> dict:\n    return {\n        \"chunk_id\": f\"{source_doc}_{chunk_id}\",\n        \"text\": content,\n        \"char_count\": len(content),\n        \"metadata\": {\"source\": source_doc, \"indexed_at\": \"2026-11-18\"}\n    }\n\nchunk_obj = create_enriched_chunk(1, \"RAG arxitekturasi\", \"ai_manual.pdf\")\nprint(chunk_obj[\"chunk_id\"], \"-> Manba:\", chunk_obj[\"metadata\"][\"source\"])",
            "expectedOutput": "ai_manual.pdf_1 -> Manba: ai_manual.pdf",
            "explanationUz": "Har bir chunk qaysi fayldan, sahifadan olingani metadatada saqlansa, kelajakda aniq iqtibos (Citation) berish mumkin bo'ladi."
          }
        ],
