        "theoryUz": "### Manual agent loop\n\n**1. Konseptual Asos va Muammo (Core Problem & Concept):**\n“Manual agent loop” — zamonaviy AI injiniring tizimlarida AI Agentlar, ReAct Loop va Multi-Step Planning yo'nalishining asosiy ustunlaridan biridir.\nBu mavzuda asosiy e'tibor quyidagi terminologik tushunchalarga qaratiladi: ReAct (Reason + Act), Thought, Action, Observation, Tool Execution, Finite State Machine, Max Iterations.\nAI muhandisligida bu konsepsiya tizimning ishonchliligi, hisoblash tezligi (low latency) va resurslarni tejamkor boshqarish uchun xizmat qiladi.\n\n**2. Ishlash Mexanizmi va Arxitektura (Under the Hood):**\nAmaliy arxitekturada ma'lumotlar oqimi quyidagi mantiqiy ketma-ketlikda ishlaydi:\n1. Kiruvchi so'rov tekshiriladi va kerakli ma'lumotlar formatiga o'tkaziladi.\n2. Tegishli algoritm yoki API xizmati yordamida deterministik hamda ehtimollik qoidalari asosida inferens bajariladi.\n3. Chiqish ma'lumotlari strukturalanadi va xatoliklar (chegaraviy holatlar) nazoratdan o'tkaziladi.\n\n**3. Ishlab chiqarish Qoidalari (Production Best Practices):**\nProduction muhitida har doim kutilmagan uzilishlar, tokenlar sarfi va kechikishlarni (P95/P99 latency) kuzatib borish talab etiladi.",
        "upstreamUrl": "https://github.com/Asabeneh/30-Days-Of-AI-Engineering/blob/391a9cc44add20cf19965e171c6e7fed3a183e67/day_22/day_22_introduction_to_ai_engineering.md",
        "visualFlow": [
          {
            "step": 1,
            "label": "Fikr (Thought)",
            "detail": "Hozirgi holat va maqsaddan kelib chiqib keyingi qadamni rejalash"
          },
          {
            "step": 2,
            "label": "Harakat (Action)",
            "detail": "Tegishli tool va argumentlarni chaqirish"
          },
          {
            "step": 3,
            "label": "Kuzatuv (Observation)",
            "detail": "Muhit yoki asbobdan natijani qabul qilish"
          },
          {
            "step": 4,
            "label": "Yakun (Finish)",
            "detail": "Maqsad bajarilgach foydalanuvchiga javob berish"
          }
        ],
        "examples": [
          {
            "titleUz": "1-misol: Manual agent loop — ReAct Sikli Holat Mashinasi Simulyatsiyasi",
            "code": "class SimpleReActAgent:\n    def __init__(self, max_steps: int = 3):\n        self.steps = 0\n        self.max_steps = max_steps\n\n    def step(self, observation: str = \"\") -> dict:\n        self.steps += 1\n        if self.steps > self.max_steps:\n            return {\"thought\": \"Limit tugadi\", \"action\": \"stop\", \"arg\": \"Muvaffaqiyatsiz\"}\n        if not observation:\n            return {\"thought\": \"Tahlil kerak, asbob chaqiraman\", \"action\": \"calculator\", \"arg\": \"15 * 4\"}\n        return {\"thought\": f\"Natija olindi: {observation}\", \"action\": \"finish\", \"arg\": f\"Javob: {observation}\"}\n\nagent = SimpleReActAgent()\ns1 = agent.step()\nprint(\"1-qadam:\", s1[\"thought\"], \"->\", s1[\"action\"])\ns2 = agent.step(observation=\"60\")\nprint(\"2-qadam:\", s2[\"thought\"], \"->\", s2[\"arg\"])",
            "expectedOutput": "1-qadam: Tahlil kerak, asbob chaqiraman -> calculator\n2-qadam: Natija olindi: 60 -> Javob: 60",
            "explanationUz": "ReAct arxitekturasida model har bir qadamda fikrlaydi (Thought), asbobni chaqiradi (Action) va natijani olib (Observation) keyingi qadamga o'tadi."
          },
          {
            "titleUz": "2-misol: Manual agent loop — Cheksiz Sikllardan (Infinite Loop) Himoyalangan Boshqaruvchi",
            "code": "def execute_bounded_agent(goal: str, max_iterations: int = 5) -> dict:\n    history = []\n    for step in range(1, max_iterations + 1):\n        if step == 2:\n            return {\"status\": \"success\", \"steps\": step, \"final\": f\"Bajarildi: {goal}\"}\n        history.append(f\"Qadam #{step}\")\n    return {\"status\": \"timeout_error\", \"steps\": max_iterations}\n\nres = execute_bounded_agent(\"Valyuta kursini olish\")\nprint(res)",
            "expectedOutput": "{'status': 'success', 'steps': 2, 'final': 'Bajarildi: Valyuta kursini olish'}",
            "explanationUz": "Agentlar o'z-o'zini qayta chaqirib qotib qolmasligi uchun doimo qat'iy `max_iterations` chegarasi qo'yiladi."
          }
        ],
